{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/issuingsdkdocs\/cardmoduleguide"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"kind":"article","sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.adyen.IssuingSDKDocs\/documentation\/IssuingSDKDocs"]]},"abstract":[{"text":"Reveal card details, reveal PINs, and change PINs using direct service calls.","type":"text"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.adyen.IssuingSDKDocs\/documentation\/IssuingSDKDocs\/CardModuleGuide","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Article","modules":[{"name":"IssuingSDKDocs"}],"title":"Card Module (Low-Level)","role":"article"},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Card"},{"type":"text","text":" module provides low-level cryptographic services for sensitive card operations. Unlike "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CardSessions"},{"type":"text","text":" (which handles networking, session management, and token handling automatically), the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Card"},{"type":"text","text":" module is a pure crypto library: you manage all network calls yourself and use the SDK only for encryption and decryption."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Card"},{"type":"text","text":" module when you need:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Full control over the network layer (custom networking stack, interceptors, retry logic)"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Integration into an architecture that doesn’t use ","type":"text"},{"code":"async\/await","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Direct access to the encrypted keys and data for custom backend flows","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If you prefer a higher-level API that handles networking and token management, use "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.adyen.IssuingSDKDocs\/documentation\/IssuingSDKDocs\/CardSessionsGuide","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" instead.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"style":"tip","type":"aside","name":"Tip"},{"anchor":"Import","text":"Import","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["import Card"]},{"type":"aside","name":"Note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"code":"Card","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" module has no dependency on ","type":"text"},{"code":"IssuingCommon","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"code":"IssuingCore","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". It is a standalone cryptographic library.","type":"text"}]}],"style":"note"},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Session-Token-Roles","text":"Session Token Roles","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Your backend needs the following API credential roles to call the Adyen endpoints used in these flows:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"table","rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Operation"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Role"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Card reveal"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Bank Issuing PaymentInstrument Reveal Webservice"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"PIN reveal"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"Bank Issuing Pin Reveal Webservice","type":"codeVoice"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"PIN change","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"Bank Issuing Pin Change Webservice","type":"codeVoice"}]}]]],"header":"row"},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Card-Reveal","text":"Card Reveal","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Reveal the card’s PAN, CVC, and expiry date.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Flow","text":"Flow","level":3},{"type":"orderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Your backend fetches a public key from Adyen (","type":"text"},{"code":"GET \/publicKey?purpose=panReveal&format=jwk","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":")","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Pass the public key to the SDK to generate an encrypted session key"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Your backend sends the encrypted key to Adyen ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"POST \/paymentInstruments\/reveal"},{"type":"text","text":") and receives encrypted card data"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Pass the encrypted data to the SDK to decrypt and obtain the card details"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Implementation","anchor":"Implementation"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["import Card","","\/\/ 1. Initialize the service","let cardRevealService = CardRevealService()","","\/\/ 2. Generate an encrypted key using the public key from your backend.","\/\/    The public key is the raw JWK data from the Adyen \/publicKey endpoint.","let (encryptedKey, revealContext) = try cardRevealService.generateEncryptedKey(","    jwk: publicKeyData",")","","\/\/ 3. Send `encryptedKey` to your backend.","\/\/    Your backend calls POST \/paymentInstruments\/reveal with:","\/\/    {","\/\/        \"paymentInstrumentId\": \"PI123...\",","\/\/        \"encryptedKey\": encryptedKey","\/\/    }","\/\/    and returns the `encryptedData` string from the response.","","\/\/ 4. Decrypt the card details","let details = try cardRevealService.cardDetails(","    encryptedData: encryptedData,","    revealContext: revealContext",")","","\/\/ Access the decrypted values","details.pan            \/\/ Full PAN, e.g. \"5412345678901234\"","details.cvc            \/\/ CVC, e.g. \"123\"","details.expiration.month  \/\/ e.g. \"03\"","details.expiration.year   \/\/ e.g. \"2028\""]},{"type":"aside","style":"important","name":"Important","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"code":"revealContext","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" returned by ","type":"text"},{"code":"generateEncryptedKey","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" must be passed to ","type":"text"},{"code":"cardDetails","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". It contains the symmetric key needed for decryption and cannot be reused across separate reveal flows.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If you have a PEM\/DER-encoded public key instead of JWK, use "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"generateEncryptedKey(pem:)"},{"type":"text","text":":"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let (encryptedKey, revealContext) = try cardRevealService.generateEncryptedKey(","    pem: derEncodedPublicKey",")"]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Error Handling","anchor":"Error-Handling"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"generateEncryptedKey"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"cardDetails"},{"text":" throw ","type":"text"},{"code":"CardRevealService.CardRevealError","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":":","type":"text"}]},{"type":"table","header":"row","rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Error","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Cause"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".invalidPublicKey"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The public key could not be parsed"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".encryptionFailed"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Key encryption failed"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".invalidEncryptedData"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The encrypted data string is not valid hex"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".decryptionFailed"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"AES decryption of the card data failed"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":".unexpectedData","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Decryption succeeded but the payload could not be decoded","type":"text"}]}]]]},{"level":2,"text":"PIN Reveal","anchor":"PIN-Reveal","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Retrieve the card’s current PIN.","type":"text"}]},{"level":3,"text":"Flow","anchor":"Flow","type":"heading"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Your backend fetches a public key from Adyen ("},{"code":"GET \/publicKey?purpose=pinReveal&format=jwk","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":")"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Pass the public key to the SDK to generate an encrypted session key","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Your backend sends the encrypted key to Adyen (","type":"text"},{"code":"POST \/pins\/reveal","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") and receives an encrypted PIN block and token","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Pass both to the SDK to decrypt and obtain the PIN","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"orderedList"},{"level":3,"text":"Implementation","anchor":"Implementation","type":"heading"},{"code":["import Card","","\/\/ 1. Initialize the service","let pinRevealService = PinRevealService()","","\/\/ 2. Generate an encrypted key","let (encryptedKey, revealContext) = try pinRevealService.generateEncryptedKey(","    jwk: publicKeyData",")","","\/\/ 3. Send `encryptedKey` to your backend.","\/\/    Your backend calls POST \/pins\/reveal with:","\/\/    {","\/\/        \"paymentInstrumentId\": \"PI123...\",","\/\/        \"encryptedKey\": encryptedKey","\/\/    }","\/\/    and returns `encryptedPinBlock` and `token` from the response.","","\/\/ 4. Decrypt the PIN","let pin = try pinRevealService.pin(","    encryptedPinBlock: encryptedPinBlock,","    token: token,","    revealContext: revealContext",")"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"level":3,"text":"Error Handling","anchor":"Error-Handling","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"generateEncryptedKey","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"pin"},{"type":"text","text":" throw "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PinRevealService.PinRevealError"},{"type":"text","text":":"}]},{"rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Error"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Cause"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".invalidPublicKey"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The public key could not be parsed","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".encryptionFailed","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Key encryption failed"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":".invalidEncryptedData","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The encrypted PIN block is not valid","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".decryptionFailed"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Decryption failed","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".unexpectedData"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Decrypted PIN block has an unexpected format","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]]],"type":"table","header":"row"},{"type":"heading","anchor":"PIN-Change","level":2,"text":"PIN Change"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Set a new PIN for the card."}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Flow","level":3,"text":"Flow"},{"type":"orderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Your backend fetches a public key from Adyen ("},{"code":"GET \/publicKey?purpose=pinChange&format=jwk","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":")"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Pass the public key and the new PIN to the SDK to generate the encrypted payload"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Your backend sends the payload to Adyen (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"POST \/pins\/change"},{"text":")","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Implementation","level":3,"text":"Implementation"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["import Card","","\/\/ 1. Initialize the service","let pinChangeService = PinChangeService()","","\/\/ 2. Generate the encrypted PIN block","let encryptedPin = try pinChangeService.encryptedPinBlock(","    jwk: publicKeyData,","    pin: newPin",")","","\/\/ 3. Send to your backend.","\/\/    Your backend calls POST \/pins\/change with:","\/\/    {","\/\/        \"paymentInstrumentId\": \"PI123...\",","\/\/        \"encryptedKey\": encryptedPin.encryptedKey,","\/\/        \"encryptedPinBlock\": encryptedPin.encryptedPinBlock,","\/\/        \"token\": encryptedPin.token","\/\/    }"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If you have a PEM\/DER-encoded public key:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let encryptedPin = try pinChangeService.encryptedPinBlock(","    pem: derEncodedPublicKey,","    pin: newPin",")"]},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Error Handling","anchor":"Error-Handling"},{"inlineContent":[{"code":"encryptedPinBlock","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" throws "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PinChangeService.PinChangeError"},{"text":":","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"header":"row","rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Error","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Cause","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".invalidPin"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The PIN is malformed (non-decimal characters, too long)"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".unallowedPin"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The PIN is not permitted (sequential like ","type":"text"},{"code":"1234","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", repeated like "},{"code":"1111","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":")","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".invalidPublicKey"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The public key could not be parsed","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".encryptionFailed","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"PIN encryption failed","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]]],"type":"table"},{"anchor":"Security-Considerations","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Security Considerations"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Card"},{"type":"text","text":" module performs all cryptographic operations in memory. No sensitive data is written to disk."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The symmetric key (inside ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RevealContext"},{"text":" \/ ","type":"text"},{"code":"PinRevealContext","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") is ephemeral and must not be persisted or transmitted.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Display sensitive data (PAN, PIN) only temporarily and clear it from the UI promptly."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Never log or persist decrypted card details or PINs.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Each ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RevealContext"},{"text":" \/ ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PinRevealContext"},{"text":" is single-use. Generate a new encrypted key for each reveal operation.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Migration-from-adyen-card-reveal-ios","text":"Migration from adyen-card-reveal-ios"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If you previously used the standalone "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Adyen\/adyen-card-reveal-ios"},{"type":"text","text":" package, the "},{"code":"Card","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" module is a direct replacement with minor API changes:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"table","header":"row","rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Old API","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"New API","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"import AdyenCardReveal","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"import Card","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"generateEncryptedKey(jwk:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" → ","type":"text"},{"code":"String","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"generateEncryptedKey(jwk:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" → "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"(encryptedKey: String, revealContext: RevealContext)"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"cardDetails(from: encryptedData)"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"cardDetails(encryptedData:, revealContext:)"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"pin(encryptedPinBlock:, token:)"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"pin(encryptedPinBlock:, token:, revealContext:)"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"encryptedPinBlock(pem:, pin:)"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"encryptedPinBlock(pem:, pin:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (unchanged)"}],"type":"paragraph"}]]]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The key change is that ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"generateEncryptedKey"},{"text":" now returns a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RevealContext"},{"text":" (or ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PinRevealContext"},{"type":"text","text":") that must be passed to the decryption method. This makes the API safer by preventing accidental reuse of keys across requests."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"https://github.com/Adyen/adyen-card-reveal-ios":{"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Adyen\/adyen-card-reveal-ios","titleInlineContent":[{"text":"adyen-card-reveal-ios","type":"text"}],"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Adyen\/adyen-card-reveal-ios","title":"adyen-card-reveal-ios","type":"link"},"doc://com.adyen.IssuingSDKDocs/documentation/IssuingSDKDocs":{"abstract":[],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/issuingsdkdocs","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.adyen.IssuingSDKDocs\/documentation\/IssuingSDKDocs","role":"collection","title":"IssuingSDKDocs","type":"topic"},"doc://com.adyen.IssuingSDKDocs/documentation/IssuingSDKDocs/CardSessionsGuide":{"title":"Card Sessions","abstract":[{"text":"Securely reveal card details, reveal PINs, and change PINs.","type":"text"}],"role":"article","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/issuingsdkdocs\/cardsessionsguide","kind":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.adyen.IssuingSDKDocs\/documentation\/IssuingSDKDocs\/CardSessionsGuide"}}}